WEBVTT

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:29.417
"Nothing Beats Peace"

00:00:29.417 --> 00:00:33.375
<i>My name is Sakurai Tomoki,</i>
<i>and I'm an ordinary student,</i>

00:00:33.375 --> 00:00:35.667
<i>who loves peace, quiet, and normalcy.</i>

00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:40.583
<i>And yet, those who are around</i>
<i>me include a girl with a killer chop,</i>

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:42.333
<i>a perv who flies through the air,</i>

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:45.958
<i>not to mention the fact</i>
<i>that I get SOS's in my dreams.</i>

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:47.333
<i>Ah, and to top it all off, </i>

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:50.375
<i>a mythical being fell out of the sky.</i>

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:56.250
<i>This is the story of</i>
<i>how my peace and quiet</i>

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.958
<i>came crumbling down around me.</i>

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.042
<i>I can hear my heart bell</i>

00:01:02.042 --> 00:01:04.625
<i>What could it mean?</i>

00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:08.333
<i>A bell in my heart is ringing</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:14.000
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:19.875
<i>It all started way back then </i>
<i>(ringin' ringin')</i>

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:25.458
<i>Ever since before we were born</i>
<i>(ringin' ringin')</i>

00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:30.708
<i>you were destined to appear out of nowhere,</i>

00:01:30.708 --> 00:01:33.708
<i>right before my eyes,</i>

00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:36.500
<i>I'm sure of it</i>

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:42.167
<i>My wishes and ambitions and daydreams</i>

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:47.833
<i>take me to an unknown level and knock on a door</i>

00:01:47.833 --> 00:01:54.042
<i>You give me the key and the future</i>
<i>I need to take flight (with your wings)</i>

00:01:54.042 --> 00:01:56.958
<i>I can hear my heart bell</i>

00:01:56.958 --> 00:02:00.000
<i>There's no stopping it</i>

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.667
<i>It's a sign, rung by an angel, saying "I love you"</i>

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:08.542
<i>Can you hear my heart bell?</i>

00:02:08.542 --> 00:02:10.875
<i>What could it mean?</i>

00:02:10.875 --> 00:02:16.292
<i>A bell in my heart that I've </i>
<i>never heard before is ringing</i>

00:02:16.292 --> 00:02:25.417
<i>But even so, you don't suspect a thing</i>

00:02:30.542 --> 00:02:35.417
Good day, ladies and gentlemen.
My name is Sugata Eishiro.

00:02:35.417 --> 00:02:37.708
This is my assistant, Pretty.

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.917
The earth is surrounded
by a magnetic force,

00:02:40.917 --> 00:02:44.792
known as geomagnetism,
with axes at the north and south poles.

00:02:44.792 --> 00:02:47.792
However, what if the
existence of this black hole

00:02:47.792 --> 00:02:51.250
slightly upsets the
earth's magnetic field?

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:54.583
Take, for example, migratory birds,
who rely upon geomagnetism

00:02:54.583 --> 00:02:56.292
to determine the direction in which to fly.

00:02:56.292 --> 00:02:59.667
Such a magnetic abnormality would
cause the bird to lose its bearings,

00:02:59.667 --> 00:03:01.583
and it would fall from the sky.

00:03:01.583 --> 00:03:04.917
Conversely, it should be possible
for something that is flightless

00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:07.417
to now be able to fly.

00:03:07.417 --> 00:03:10.000
There is a reason for all things.

00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:15.458
In other words, there is a
reason why things that fly can fly.

00:03:15.458 --> 00:03:18.458
The crucial thing is that first bird!

00:03:19.375 --> 00:03:19.958
"New World"

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.917
Oh dear, it failed.

00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:28.958
"An Airborne Prismatic Panty Adventure"

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.708
Please, don't let these get any bigger.

00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:53.625
Tomo! Good morning!

00:03:55.125 --> 00:03:58.167
Geez, he's still asleep.

00:03:58.167 --> 00:04:01.792
Tomo, get up! You'll be late...

00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:07.542
I-It's not like that, Sohara.

00:04:07.542 --> 00:04:10.542
I was just trying to
get this chain off, when...

00:04:16.292 --> 00:04:17.875
What exactly is going on?!

00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:20.875
Who is she?!
What is she doing in your house?!

00:04:20.875 --> 00:04:23.292
Well, you see, as it happens...

00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:29.417
She fell out of the sky.

00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:36.458
Tomo, you idiot! There's no
way I'm going to believe that story!

00:04:36.458 --> 00:04:39.167
It's the truth! Look, Sohara!

00:04:39.167 --> 00:04:41.083
Look, look! She's flying!

00:04:41.083 --> 00:04:42.292
See? See?

00:04:42.292 --> 00:04:44.292
Look. See? See?

00:04:47.583 --> 00:04:49.208
Sohara!

00:04:54.042 --> 00:04:55.875
Sohara!

00:04:57.458 --> 00:05:02.292
B-Before anything else,
we have to do something about this chain.

00:05:02.292 --> 00:05:04.833
Um, if the chain is an issue,

00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:07.583
I can freely lengthen it or make it disappear.

00:05:07.583 --> 00:05:10.125
Why didn't you say so sooner?!

00:05:10.125 --> 00:05:11.375
Okay, I'm off!

00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:13.000
Yes, Master.

00:05:19.542 --> 00:05:21.167
Sohara!

00:05:22.708 --> 00:05:25.125
Listen to what I'm saying!

00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:31.375
Wah, Ikaros! You can't follow me!

00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:33.375
Just come over here!

00:05:34.167 --> 00:05:35.375
Ho?

00:05:35.375 --> 00:05:37.333
You've outdone yourself, Tomoki.

00:05:37.333 --> 00:05:39.792
This is undoubtedly an
inhabitant of the New World.

00:05:39.792 --> 00:05:41.958
How do you figure that?!

00:05:41.958 --> 00:05:44.792
As I recall, you live by yourself, right?

00:05:44.792 --> 00:05:47.750
Your parents are off touring
the country, or something.

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.125
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:49.125 --> 00:05:52.875
Perfect. Look after her
until we know more details,

00:05:52.875 --> 00:05:55.000
for the sake of the New World.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:59.375
Are you sure, Sakurai?
If you live together with this cute girl,

00:05:59.375 --> 00:06:01.583
won't there be some impropriety?

00:06:01.583 --> 00:06:03.458
I-Impropriety?

00:06:03.458 --> 00:06:07.792
Oh, let's say, you accidentally push
her down onto your bed,

00:06:07.792 --> 00:06:09.750
and then your childhood
friend walks in and sees you,

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:12.250
and a love triangle situation
erupts, or something.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.083
Y-You saw that?

00:06:14.083 --> 00:06:16.083
Oh, it was just a hunch.

00:06:16.083 --> 00:06:19.375
However, a woman's jealousy is a scary thing.

00:06:19.375 --> 00:06:22.208
I do hope this doesn't end in blood.

00:06:23.167 --> 00:06:26.000
Don't say things like that, Chairman!

00:06:29.792 --> 00:06:34.500
Ikaros, you go on home,
and stay there quietly. Understood?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.208
In that case, Master, here.

00:06:37.208 --> 00:06:38.875
What's this?

00:06:38.875 --> 00:06:44.792
It is an old-style card.
I am all out of the new cards.

00:06:44.792 --> 00:06:46.250
So you have these, too?

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.500
Master, that card will--

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.667
Yeah, okay, I get it.

00:06:49.667 --> 00:06:53.375
Never mind that, Ikaros,
you head straight home. Got it?

00:06:53.375 --> 00:06:55.208
Yes, Master.

00:06:56.875 --> 00:07:00.125
<i>Ah, I love this feeling. </i>

00:07:00.125 --> 00:07:02.583
<i>Sure enough, nothing beats peace and quiet.</i>

00:07:02.583 --> 00:07:04.792
<i>Peace and quiet is the best!</i>

00:07:04.792 --> 00:07:08.250
<i>Nothing has gone right these last few days.</i>

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:12.417
<i>Come to think of it,</i>
<i>what about this old-style card?</i>

00:07:12.417 --> 00:07:15.708
<i>Nah, it's too dangerous</i>
<i>for me to use these things.</i>

00:07:15.708 --> 00:07:18.958
<i>Appearances to the contrary,</i>
<i>I do learn from my mistakes.</i>

00:07:20.208 --> 00:07:24.917
<i>But then, some erotic powers</i>
<i>would be nice to have, huh?</i>

00:07:29.625 --> 00:07:32.250
Tomo, let's have our lunch outside.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:35.292
I brought a lunch for you, too, after all.

00:07:35.292 --> 00:07:37.625
Sure. Thanks, as always.

00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:40.208
Listen, about that girl...

00:07:40.208 --> 00:07:42.083
Oh, Ikaros?

00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:44.000
Is she really going to live with you?

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.542
Well, we'll see what happens.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.833
Huh? Are you mad?

00:07:49.833 --> 00:07:52.125
No, I'm not really mad.

00:07:52.125 --> 00:07:54.958
If that's what you've decided,
Tomo, what can I do?

00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:57.458
But it sounds to me like you're mad.

00:07:57.458 --> 00:07:59.167
I told you, I'm not mad!

00:07:59.167 --> 00:08:02.833
Hey, if you're in too much
of a hurry, you're gonna trip.

00:08:03.792 --> 00:08:05.458
There, what did I tell you?

00:08:05.458 --> 00:08:08.208
"Woof"

00:08:09.667 --> 00:08:10.625
Did you look?

00:08:10.625 --> 00:08:12.250
I didn't, I didn't!

00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:14.792
<i>Puppy-themed panties, huh? </i>

00:08:14.792 --> 00:08:17.500
<i>Sohara isn't in grade school anymore.</i>

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:20.500
<i>She should wear something</i>
<i>a little more, you know...</i>

00:08:23.542 --> 00:08:24.958
What?

00:08:26.708 --> 00:08:28.000
N-No way!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.750
Hey, aren't those...

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.208
Panties, aren't they?

00:08:32.208 --> 00:08:35.542
Those panties... They couldn't be...!

00:08:35.542 --> 00:08:39.250
Tomo, what is that
glowing in your pocket?

00:08:41.875 --> 00:08:43.792
Don't tell me...

00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:49.958
It's because of this card?

00:08:56.208 --> 00:08:57.792
Tomo, you idiot!

00:08:57.792 --> 00:09:00.042
But I didn't do anything!

00:09:00.042 --> 00:09:01.417
This card probably did it on its own--

00:09:01.417 --> 00:09:02.667
Explain later.

00:09:02.667 --> 00:09:05.667
Right now, I have to hurry up and change.

00:09:12.458 --> 00:09:13.417
"New World Discovery Club"

00:09:13.417 --> 00:09:17.208
Sugata, please let me
use the room for a minute.

00:09:18.458 --> 00:09:20.042
Has something happened?

00:09:20.042 --> 00:09:23.917
Something outrageous has
happened, thanks to this card.

00:09:23.917 --> 00:09:24.875
What?

00:09:24.875 --> 00:09:28.083
Geez, what's going on,
for crying out loud?

00:09:28.083 --> 00:09:31.083
Tomo has always been a little sicko.

00:09:42.708 --> 00:09:45.000
What's wrong, Sohara?!

00:09:46.667 --> 00:09:48.500
What in the world...?

00:09:48.917 --> 00:09:53.208
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:09:54.458 --> 00:09:57.167
Geez, what is going on?

00:10:03.875 --> 00:10:08.083
No matter what you try to
put on, they all go flying away.

00:10:08.083 --> 00:10:11.708
Indeed. It's all this card's doing, is it?

00:10:11.708 --> 00:10:15.500
Tomo, what's the big idea?
Do something!

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.167
Don't look at me.

00:10:17.167 --> 00:10:19.875
Mitsuki, try putting this on.

00:10:19.875 --> 00:10:21.250
What is that?

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.000
A loincloth.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.458
Why do you have that?!

00:10:23.458 --> 00:10:25.875
Sugata, is that one of your own?

00:10:27.542 --> 00:10:29.292
<i>There are any number of things in this room.</i>

00:10:29.292 --> 00:10:32.292
<i>We should experiment with different things.</i>

00:10:38.792 --> 00:10:40.875
Bright red bikini...

00:10:40.875 --> 00:10:42.792
Fishnet tights...

00:10:42.792 --> 00:10:44.417
Roll bandage...

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.000
You're a real freak,
making her wear bandages.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.583
Hmm, it appears that
anything she puts on is no good,

00:10:50.583 --> 00:10:52.917
and it's not limited to underwear.

00:10:52.917 --> 00:10:54.958
This is a real problem for Sohara.

00:10:54.958 --> 00:10:57.792
And just whose fault do you think this is?!

00:10:59.583 --> 00:11:01.208
I'm sorry!

00:11:02.042 --> 00:11:04.875
I get the feeling that Master is in trouble.

00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:09.625
Not even my jersey will work, huh?

00:11:09.625 --> 00:11:11.875
I can't take it anymore!

00:11:11.875 --> 00:11:16.750
Could it be, Sohara, that you have
to go commando the rest of your life?

00:11:18.708 --> 00:11:21.583
Oh? Sakurai, you seem pleased.

00:11:21.583 --> 00:11:23.333
That's not true!

00:11:23.333 --> 00:11:25.583
Who knew you had such tastes?

00:11:25.583 --> 00:11:28.458
By any chance,
was this your plan from the start?

00:11:28.458 --> 00:11:30.000
N-No, it wasn't!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.042
No, we cannot dismiss the possibility.

00:11:33.042 --> 00:11:37.625
Not if this card was granting
your unconscious desire.

00:11:37.625 --> 00:11:40.083
Let's do an experiment, Tomoki.

00:11:40.083 --> 00:11:42.625
Concentrate on this card for something.

00:11:42.625 --> 00:11:44.125
O-Okay...

00:11:50.708 --> 00:11:51.917
Handcuffs?

00:11:51.917 --> 00:11:54.042
What in the world...?

00:11:54.042 --> 00:11:56.000
I get it!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.125
What?

00:11:57.125 --> 00:11:58.542
There.

00:11:59.208 --> 00:12:00.208
What's the meaning of this?

00:12:00.208 --> 00:12:03.125
Oh, I just wanted to try it.

00:12:03.125 --> 00:12:04.458
And...?

00:12:04.458 --> 00:12:08.208
I'm not wearing anything right now.

00:12:08.208 --> 00:12:10.417
If the wind blows, in the state I'm in,

00:12:10.417 --> 00:12:13.417
how am I supposed to hold my skirt down?

00:12:22.375 --> 00:12:24.958
Is something troubling you, Master?

00:12:24.958 --> 00:12:26.792
Safe...!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:30.292
Or is it out?!

00:12:30.292 --> 00:12:31.083
Master?

00:12:31.083 --> 00:12:33.042
Pa-- Pa-- Pa--

00:12:33.042 --> 00:12:33.875
Pa--?

00:12:33.875 --> 00:12:35.542
Panties...!

00:12:35.542 --> 00:12:37.167
Panties!

00:12:37.167 --> 00:12:39.500
Yes, panties. All right,

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:43.458
I shall collect every pair of panties
within a 100 meter radius.

00:12:43.458 --> 00:12:44.917
Oh, no way!

00:12:44.917 --> 00:12:48.542
So then, in one of the
extras in this month's issue--

00:12:55.833 --> 00:12:57.500
What's wrong, Mikako?

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.208
They got me, too.

00:13:06.125 --> 00:13:08.167
They're still warm.

00:13:08.167 --> 00:13:10.083
Will this do, Master?

00:13:10.083 --> 00:13:11.792
N-No!

00:13:19.208 --> 00:13:21.792
Our panties...

00:13:21.792 --> 00:13:24.500
They're flying away into the sky.

00:13:33.625 --> 00:13:36.292
Listen here, Tomo.

00:13:36.292 --> 00:13:39.417
Listen to what Grandpa has to say.

00:13:39.417 --> 00:13:42.250
The thing about a gaggle of geese

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.542
is that if you fail to hit the very first one,

00:13:44.542 --> 00:13:48.500
the rest of them will all fly away.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:53.000
So you have to make
sure you hit that first one, okay?

00:13:59.167 --> 00:14:02.250
<i>Don't forget, Tomo,</i>

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.875
<i>it's that first one.</i>

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:17.958
<i>It's that first one.</i>

00:14:20.458 --> 00:14:25.625
Explain something to me.
Ikaros, is this all the card's doing?

00:14:25.625 --> 00:14:30.000
Yes. This card is what
we call a transport device,

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.042
which calls for various things from Synapse.

00:14:33.042 --> 00:14:38.375
The older cards only have the
ability to grant one thing per card.

00:14:38.375 --> 00:14:40.542
For example, this card was used

00:14:40.542 --> 00:14:44.375
to forcibly grant the master's desire.

00:14:44.375 --> 00:14:48.083
I see. That unravels
the mystery of this incident.

00:14:48.083 --> 00:14:50.042
What does it mean, Sugata?

00:14:50.042 --> 00:14:51.458
Allow me to explain.

00:14:51.458 --> 00:14:53.250
It works as follows:

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:55.833
The panties that Mitsuki
showed off when she tripped

00:14:55.833 --> 00:14:58.625
were not to Tomoki's liking.

00:14:58.625 --> 00:15:01.542
As a result, the card activated,

00:15:01.542 --> 00:15:05.667
and forcibly removed the
underwear that Tomoki didn't like.

00:15:05.667 --> 00:15:08.542
The handcuffs were also
nothing more than an implement

00:15:08.542 --> 00:15:11.083
to force Mitsuki to do as he wished.

00:15:11.083 --> 00:15:14.958
Sakurai, you're more of
a savage than I figured you for.

00:15:14.958 --> 00:15:16.875
I need to give you more credit.

00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:19.542
Oh, no, the card did this all on its own!

00:15:19.542 --> 00:15:22.833
So, what am I supposed to do?

00:15:22.833 --> 00:15:26.417
Now that we know the cause,
the solution should be simple.

00:15:26.417 --> 00:15:30.708
Mitsuki, you just have to put
on some panties that Tomoki likes.

00:15:32.042 --> 00:15:34.000
Let's ask Ikaros and Mikako to go and buy

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:34.500
--as many pairs of panties as they can.

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:37.417
--I like the kind you can see right through.
--as many pairs of panties as they can.

00:15:37.417 --> 00:15:41.833
Which means that I'll have to
try them all, one at a time, right?

00:15:41.833 --> 00:15:45.250
But first, we have to get
home without any incident.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.167
It's all right. Leave that to me.

00:15:48.167 --> 00:15:51.125
Sohara, I will protect your flower patch!

00:15:52.542 --> 00:15:54.042
You're kidding, right?

00:15:54.042 --> 00:15:56.125
It almost seems like someone's out to get you.

00:15:56.125 --> 00:15:59.292
This is going to reflect up on me.

00:15:59.292 --> 00:16:02.375
Let me take care of it! I've trained for this!

00:16:02.375 --> 00:16:04.208
Pantser On!!

00:16:07.667 --> 00:16:10.542
Shouldn't you be facing the other way?

00:16:10.542 --> 00:16:12.375
Scramble Pants!!

00:16:16.875 --> 00:16:17.792
Tomo,

00:16:17.792 --> 00:16:21.917
do me a favor? Hold my skirt down tight,
to keep it from flipping up.

00:16:22.708 --> 00:16:25.000
Atomic Pants!!

00:16:28.292 --> 00:16:31.292
Pants Spin Kick!!

00:16:32.542 --> 00:16:35.375
Pantser Break!!

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:41.417
<i>Tomoki is going all-out.</i>
<i>He's transcended human motion.</i>

00:16:42.333 --> 00:16:43.958
We're home!

00:16:44.833 --> 00:16:46.875
We bought them, Master.

00:16:46.875 --> 00:16:49.208
Oh, there are so many of them!

00:16:49.208 --> 00:16:50.458
With this many pairs,

00:16:50.458 --> 00:16:53.917
Sakurai should find at
least one of them to his liking.

00:16:56.583 --> 00:16:58.583
Okay, I'll start putting them on.

00:16:58.583 --> 00:17:01.542
Chairman, could you
and Ikaros give me a hand?

00:17:01.542 --> 00:17:03.542
I can't really move like this.

00:17:03.542 --> 00:17:04.542
Yes.

00:17:04.542 --> 00:17:07.292
Okay, let's start trying these on!

00:17:07.292 --> 00:17:10.583
Say, how about this pair?

00:17:10.583 --> 00:17:13.667
Sakurai seems to have
a masochistic streak, after all.

00:17:13.667 --> 00:17:15.042
I'll try them on.

00:17:15.042 --> 00:17:18.375
Oh, Ikaros, I'm sorry about this,

00:17:18.375 --> 00:17:19.958
but could you help me?

00:17:19.958 --> 00:17:21.375
Yes.

00:17:26.333 --> 00:17:27.958
Go ahead.

00:17:31.458 --> 00:17:35.542
That tickles, Ikaros!
Your hands are touching my...

00:17:35.542 --> 00:17:37.667
I am sorry. Um...

00:17:37.667 --> 00:17:41.208
I'm really sorry about having
to ask you to help me like this.

00:17:41.208 --> 00:17:42.917
It doesn't bother you?

00:17:42.917 --> 00:17:45.333
No, I am fine.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.875
You sure are nice, huh?

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.708
Thank you, Ikaros.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:01.917
Aw, no good...

00:18:01.917 --> 00:18:04.875
Well, how about this for the next one?

00:18:04.875 --> 00:18:07.875
They're more on the innocent side,
and not very fancy.

00:18:15.417 --> 00:18:17.625
What's going on here, Tomo?!

00:18:17.625 --> 00:18:20.250
With as many as we had here,
<i>none </i>of them were any good?!

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:24.417
You're not saying you'd
prefer I went panty-free, are you?!

00:18:24.417 --> 00:18:26.000
Quite the little savage.

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:30.333
N-No... But at this point, Sohara,
you should prepare yourself.

00:18:30.333 --> 00:18:31.250
For what?

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.958
A lifelong commando lifestyle.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:36.375
Miss Sohara...

00:18:36.375 --> 00:18:38.667
There was one more pair, under the bag.

00:18:38.667 --> 00:18:39.958
"Gowrr"

00:18:39.958 --> 00:18:41.542
I doubt those will be any good.

00:18:41.542 --> 00:18:45.375
I mean, they're almost the same
as what I had on to begin with.

00:18:45.375 --> 00:18:46.750
Is that so?

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.708
But I'll try them on, anyhow.

00:18:58.875 --> 00:19:00.917
So, were they no good, either?

00:19:00.917 --> 00:19:03.125
It's been nice knowing you,
short though it's been.

00:19:03.125 --> 00:19:05.750
P-Please don't abandon me!

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:07.583
I got them on!

00:19:07.583 --> 00:19:10.125
I got them on! I got them on, Tomo!

00:19:10.125 --> 00:19:12.875
Look. The handcuffs are off, too,
and I'm right as rain.

00:19:12.875 --> 00:19:15.000
Really? It all worked out?

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:20.042
Yes. The card automatically
shut down, so everything is okay now.

00:19:20.042 --> 00:19:22.125
Thank goodness.

00:19:22.125 --> 00:19:24.250
Still, I don't quite get it.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:28.042
That pair of underwear was
almost the same as the original, right?

00:19:28.042 --> 00:19:30.667
Now that you mention it,
I wonder why that is.

00:19:30.667 --> 00:19:32.083
Oh, who cares?

00:19:32.083 --> 00:19:35.917
I don't even want to
think about panties for a while.

00:19:35.917 --> 00:19:37.917
I guess you're right.

00:19:44.333 --> 00:19:46.583
Sorry about what happened today, Sohara.

00:19:46.583 --> 00:19:49.167
It's all right. Matter resolved.

00:19:49.167 --> 00:19:53.167
Ikaros didn't give me that
card with any misplaced intentions.

00:19:53.167 --> 00:19:55.167
Mm-hmm, I know.

00:19:58.792 --> 00:20:02.250
Tomo, you and Ikaros
are going to be living together

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.375
for a little while, right?

00:20:04.375 --> 00:20:08.042
Yeah. You know,
I can't just leave her hanging.

00:20:08.042 --> 00:20:10.667
She doesn't have anywhere else to go.

00:20:10.667 --> 00:20:13.375
And that collar of hers has me concerned.

00:20:14.625 --> 00:20:16.917
That sounds like you, Tomo.

00:20:16.917 --> 00:20:20.333
I mean, you've always been like that.

00:20:20.333 --> 00:20:23.708
When you were little, you would
bring lost puppies home right away,

00:20:23.708 --> 00:20:25.750
and you felt sorry for
them having to wear a collar,

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.750
so you took the liberty of removing them.

00:20:30.833 --> 00:20:35.417
But then, Tomo,
it's that kind-heartedness that I find...

00:20:35.417 --> 00:20:36.625
Huh?

00:20:36.625 --> 00:20:38.208
Mm-mm, nothing!

00:20:39.458 --> 00:20:42.250
You have to admit,
with those puppy panties,

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:44.542
you haven't changed at all.

00:20:45.333 --> 00:20:48.042
You don't remember, way back?

00:20:50.333 --> 00:20:54.958
Tomo, I can't do it!
There's no way I can break these!

00:20:54.958 --> 00:20:58.625
You fool! It's your fight!
You don't have enough fight in you!

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:04.333
All right, time for some Spartan training.

00:21:05.583 --> 00:21:08.625
Ho-ho, puppy-themed panties, huh?

00:21:08.625 --> 00:21:11.708
Print panties are the best kind.

00:21:23.875 --> 00:21:26.000
Come to think of it, Sohara,

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:29.625
that was the first time
your killer chop came to life.

00:21:31.958 --> 00:21:37.125
I remember! As a result of
that trauma, I came to dislike dogs!

00:21:37.125 --> 00:21:41.500
So that's it. That's why
puppy panties were no good.

00:21:42.708 --> 00:21:47.333
That's the reason why I had
to go through all of this?

00:21:48.167 --> 00:21:50.542
Then it really is
your fault, isn't it, Tomo?!

00:21:50.542 --> 00:21:52.500
You idiot!

00:22:20.708 --> 00:22:30.167
<i>I came to visit the cape</i>

00:22:30.167 --> 00:22:39.583
<i>that you once told me about</i>

00:22:39.583 --> 00:22:48.917
<i>We promised we'd come together,</i>

00:22:48.917 --> 00:22:58.333
<i>but that can no longer be</i>

00:22:58.333 --> 00:23:07.708
<i>As the tour bus runs around the cape</i>

00:23:07.708 --> 00:23:17.125
<i>the blue sea stretches out through the window</i>

00:23:17.125 --> 00:23:26.500
<i>After I push this sorrow deep into my heart,</i>

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:36.833
<i>I'll end this trip, and go back to the city</i>

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:38.500
"Worldwide Panty Meteor Swarm Appears!!"

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:41.208
"Worldwide Panty Meteor Swarm Appears!!"
In other news, an incredibly rare panty meteor shower

00:23:41.208 --> 00:23:44.583
"Worldwide Panty Meteor Swarm Appears!!"
has been spotted in the skies all over the world.

00:23:44.583 --> 00:23:47.208
Many experts are looking into
the cause of this odd phenomenon,

00:23:47.208 --> 00:23:50.250
and each organization involved
is suggesting further investigation.

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:51.208
Here in New York,

00:23:51.208 --> 00:23:53.958
the swarm has been
spotted many times since last night,

00:23:53.958 --> 00:23:56.458
and the population has spent an uneasy night.

00:23:56.458 --> 00:23:59.958
At the White House, many members
of the cabinet have been in and out,

00:23:59.958 --> 00:24:08.086
and we are anticipating official
measures to solve this matter soon.
